e timeout did not recur. Its Node and Counter phases were unrun. Exactly those three unchanged cases then passed together once in 12575 CLOSED 0, without deadline, assertion or pool edits. Actual downstream command bodies were subsequently completed separately on the final candidate in 52508 CLOSED 0: 25 Node and 55 Counter passes. These focused and downstream passes do not turn either composed gate green and do not prove a host-load cause. The bounded, unchanged-case failures and completed downstream phases do not presently identify another slice defect requiring a code change; broader gate stability remains open under 1d3a13e3. F1 is an actual counter defect and blocks this Source approval; F2 also needs correction. A changed implementation freeze needs its own one gate under repository rules.\n\nThe previously repaired failure-counter reset and typed/query-page witnesses remain intact. No additional finding from the completed review. Calibration provenance, live SQL/health/storage demonstration and parent observability acceptance remain owed; no landing, publication or provider authority is granted. Cloudflare/publication hold remains in force.","body":{"artifact":"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:27e7b50879a81f695592a2cd17c39b1dee2caa4d","binding":"assigned","head":"1f2aba037de9157dc6a60f11f2d79e797c70db4b","head_news_acknowledged":"[\"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:7db249ed8156d93197aa4ffc64a2d5c66420e5d7\"]","implementations":"[\"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:d36bcb78f07749c1e438d3db6c3658df3aaba281\"]","review_frontier":"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:c3811bf53f0b781d1f3d2903470aaaa1ac924b6f","review_path":"reviewguard@1","verdict":"changes-requested"}}